== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_2_Pets|Tier 2]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Voidfiend}}. 

Periodically yields void mana based on Pet level and Void Mana earned from a single Void Entity. increases the effectiveness of void mana and allows getting temporary buffs from [[Void Entities]].

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] each time it grants Void Mana with its main ability, xp amount depends on amount of Void Mana granted.

Doesn't work offline.

== Pet Abilities ==

On ability activation (every 5 seconds), yields Void Mana, equal to:
<br><math>E \times P^{0.7} \times \frac{L}{40}</math>
<br>''Note: minimum ability charge time is 0.1 seconds, even with {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Whiplash}} and {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Collar Of Obedience}}''

Multiplies Void Mana Profit by:
<br><math>(V + 1)^{0.21} \times P^{0.9} \times \frac{L}{150} + 2</math>



where:
* <math>E = \text{Void Mana per Entity}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>V = \text{All Void Mana this Exile}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Accrues experience each time it grants Void Mana with its ability, equal to:
<br><math>\left( 300 \times \log_{10}(V) + F \right) \times M</math>

This XP pool is distributed over time, at a rate each second of:
<br><math>1 + \frac{X}{10}</math>

where:
* <math>V = \text{Void Mana Granted}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>X = \text{Accrued Pet XP}</math>

